Template: ibhics/already-installed
Type: note
Description: ibHiCS is already installed on ${DISK}
 The server started the installer again because the installer ISO is still
 attached (BMC virtual media often ignores the eject). Nothing has been erased.
 .
 Detach the ISO, then choose Continue: the server restarts into ibHiCS.
 .
 To reinstall over it, restart from the ISO and pick "Install ibHiCS, choose
 disk and network by hand".
